19476318,"text_excerpt":"Loved this hotel. Complimentary breakfast which included made to order omelets. 24 hour fitness center, small only 2 treadmills, 2 bikes and some weights."},{"business_id":"MUulT4nQqWBKuq0ZX2UZtg","review_id":"2ZMwGLTAuYPq1rFo-MmHHQ","date":"2016-12-22T15:30:17","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.8832105398178101,"text_excerpt":"Probably the best overall Hyatt House I've ever stayed at. Getting into the hotel is a bit strange (you see the late sign off Poydras, but then the hotel lobby is midway up an office/condo building). The rooms seem brand new and are well decorated. Try and get a studio suite if possible. The cooked-to-order breakfast they serve each morning is complimentary and pretty good for hotel fare. On the weekends and during big events the lines can get long, so try and go during off peak hours."}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
